    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Hoist your sails and arm your cannons. The only thing more dangerous than the sea is the others you share it with.</i>&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 pirates battle it out either online or locally. Sink your rivals, gather gold, and dominate the oceans. The pirates with the most treasure at the end <strong>wins</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plunderdome</strong> is a <strong>top-down</strong>, <strong>multiplayer</strong>, <strong>couch-party game</strong> that blends <strong>arcade-style naval combat</strong> with a <strong>unique drafting system</strong>. Form a strategy as you pick your ships parts, before battling across open seas and archipelagos. Play <strong>free for all or with a team</strong> across a variety of game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-8 players local or online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 different combinations to draft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag, King of the Hill, FFA, Team Deathmatch, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as teams, or free for all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original sound track</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Hoist your sails and arm your cannons. The only thing more dangerous than the sea is the others you share it with.</i>&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 pirates battle it out either online or locally. Sink your rivals, gather gold, and dominate the oceans. The pirates with the most treasure at the end <strong>wins</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plunderdome</strong> is a <strong>top-down</strong>, <strong>multiplayer</strong>, <strong>couch-party game</strong> that blends <strong>arcade-style naval combat</strong> with a <strong>unique drafting system</strong>. Form a strategy as you pick your ships parts, before battling across open seas and archipelagos. Play <strong>free for all or with a team</strong> across a variety of game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-8 players local or online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 different combinations to draft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag, King of the Hill, FFA, Team Deathmatch, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as teams, or free for all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original sound track</p></li></ul>",
